f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. On the middle of the grids, January to February ran 37% of normal in 2025 and October to November ran 60% of normal in 2025. Grid 25371 had its driest year in 1963 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
